an7.67:4.2 | S: This is the third essential … | T: With this third requisite of a fortress it is well provided for the protection of those within and to ward off those without.
an7.67:5.1 | S: Furthermore, a citadel has stores of many weapons, both projectile and hand-held. | T: “And further, in the royal frontier fortress many weapons are stored, both arrows & things to be hurled.
