an7.67:8.2 | S: This is the seventh essential with which a king’s frontier citadel is well provided, to defend those within and repel those outside. | T: With this seventh requisite of a fortress it is well provided for the protection of those within and to ward off those without.
an7.67:8.3 | S: With these seven essentials a citadel is well provided. | T: “These are the seven requisites of a fortress with which it is well provided.
