an7.67:12.3 | S: These are the four kinds of sustenance it gets when needed, without trouble or difficulty. | T: These are the four types of food it can obtain at will, without difficulty, without trouble.
an7.67:13.1 | S: When a king’s frontier citadel is well provided with seven essentials and gets four kinds of sustenance when needed, without trouble or difficulty, | T: “When a royal frontier fortress is well provided with these seven requisites of a fortress, and can obtain at will—without difficulty, without trouble—these four types of food,
an7.67:13.2 | S: it is then called a king’s frontier citadel that cannot be overrun by external foes and enemies. | T: then it is said to be a royal frontier fortress that can’t be undone by external foes or duplicitous allies.
